WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.973
SHOW. A torch and toy car are placed on a table.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:06.867
POWER. Label the battery compartment safely.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:12.019
COMPARE. Working torch lights; removed battery makes it go off.

00:00:12.867 --> 00:00:16.387
SAFETY. Display no-opening and no-chewing battery warnings.
